  "description": "AWS Secrets Manager provider for GM.Secrets — reads the configured secrets (a JSON secret is flattened into keys, a plain one is keyed by its name) with the AWS SDK's default credential chain, and loads them into IConfiguration at startup, with optional periodic reload. Works with LocalStack/moto via ServiceUrl. Register with builder.AddGMSecrets(s => s.AddAwsSecretsManager()) and select via Secrets:Provider = \"AwsSecretsManager\".",
